{"task_id": "HumanEval/49", "solution": "def modp(n: int, p: int):\n    \"\"\"Return 2^n modulo p (be aware of numerics).\"\"\"\n    result = 1\n    base = 2\n    base %= p  # Ensure base is within modulo range\n\n    while n > 0:\n        if n % 2 == 1:  # If n is odd, multiply result with base\n            result = (result * base) % p\n        base = (base * base) % p  # Square the base\n        n //= 2  # Halve the exponent\n    return result"}
